      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc χMT is 62.93 cm3 K mol-1 at 300 K (below 70.92 expected for six free TbIII), remaining almost invariable over a broad range then decreasing to 33.69 cm3 K mol-1 at 2 K, attributed mainly to Stark-level depopulation. Magnetization at 3 K reaches 25.77 μB at 50 kOe without saturation; M vs H/T plots do not superimpose, indicating anisotropy and/or low-lying excited states. No SMM ac signals reported.",
